# Consolidated Screening List screen: Carlos Smith

Observation only: this report records what the Consolidated Screening List file contained when read at the time below. A name match is not a determination that a party is the listed person or entity, and no match is not a screening clearance.

## Matching rule

Names are compared after folding case and replacing every character that is not a letter or digit with a space. An exact match is the whole normalised query equal to the whole normalised name; a contains match is the normalised query appearing inside the normalised name as whole words. The name column and every alt_names entry are both checked. No fuzzy or phonetic score is computed or claimed.

